                  <p class="home-split-card__text">Search original works from hundreds of years of Canadian history, including books, reports, pamphlets, and more.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="home-split-card__actions">
                  <a href="/catalog?f%5Bcollection_tsim_str%5D%5B%5D=Monographs+%7C+Monographies&q=&search_field=all_fields&lang=<%= I18n.locale %>" class="btn btn-sm home-split-card__cta">Browse</a>
