              <div class="home-split-card__content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="home-split-card__title">Government Publications</h3>
                  <p class="home-split-card__text">See how Canada was governed through acts, debates, reports, and treaties created by colonial, provincial, and federal offices.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="home-split-card__actions">
                  <a href="/catalog?f%5Bcollection_tsim_str%5D%5B%5D=Government+Publications+%7C+Publications+gouvernementales&q=&search_field=all_fields&lang=<%= I18n.locale %>" class="btn btn-sm home-split-card__cta">Browse</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-split-card__media">
                <img src="/assets/govpubs.jpg" alt="Government publications" loading="lazy">
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="home-split-card home-split-card--teal">
              <div class="home-split-card__content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="home-split-card__title">Maps</h3>
                  <p class="home-split-card__text">View detailed maps of every province and territory, created between 1905 and 2012. Watch how Canada’s places and boundaries have shifted over time.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="home-split-card__actions">
                  <a href="/catalog?f%5Bcollection_tsim_str%5D%5B%5D=Maps+%7C+Cartes&q=&search_field=all_fields&lang=<%= I18n.locale %>" class="btn btn-sm home-split-card__cta">Browse</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-split-card__media">
                <img src="/assets/maps.jpg" alt="Maps" loading="lazy">
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="home-slider__nav home-slider__nav--next" data-slider-next aria-label="Next cards">
          <i class="bi bi-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-section home-intro home-intro--heritage">
    <div class="canadiana-shell home-heritage-intro-grid">
      <div class="home-heritage-intro-copy">
        <h2 class="section-title">Heritage Collection</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">
        The Héritage collection is a partnership with <a href="https://library-archives.canada.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Library and Archives Canada</a> (LAC) to digitize and make accessible the rich resources of archival microfilm held by LAC. With more than 37 million pages of primary-source documents, Héritage chronicles Canada and its peoples from the 1600s to the 1980s. Héritage is an unparalleled resource supporting researchers and communities across Canada.
        </p>
        <a class="home-inline-link home-inline-link--arrow" href="<%= I18n.t('links.URL_HERITAGE') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Learn more
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-right-short" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-heritage-logo-card" aria-hidden="true">
        <img class="home-heritage-logo" src="/assets/canada-wordmark.svg" alt="Government of Canada symbol" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="search-heritage" class="home-collection-band home-collection-band--green home-collection-band--reverse home-collection-band--heritage">
    <div class="canadiana-shell">
      <div class="home-collection-band__panel">
        <div class="home-collection-band__copy">
          <p class="home-eyebrow">Search the Héritage Collection</p>
          <h3>Four centuries of archival materials, from landmark papers and government files to Indigenous affairs and genealogy.</h3>

          <form class="band-search-form band-search-form--heritage" action="/catalog" method="get">
